{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Hey Maria, I've been busy doing the petition I started - it's tricky but it's been cool getting back in touch with my buddies and gaining support. I got this picture of my workmates when we went on a hiking trip, they really make me keep going! What have you been up to? Anything new with your charity?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_16-8de30bdd540d4e869cb2391b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:13:59.735873+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "8de30bdd540d4e869cb2391b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "8de30bdd540d4e869cb2391b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Hey John! Cool that it's going well - you and your friends look like a great team! I'm busy at the shelter getting ready for a fundraiser next week. Hopefully, I can raise enough to cover basic needs for the homeless."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_16-dac726528fd4ba7f6fada78c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:13:59.771291+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "dac726528fd4ba7f6fada78c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "dac726528fd4ba7f6fada78c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Wow, Maria! Raising money is crucial for those in need. Is there any way I can help out with your fundraiser?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_16-da3f0c2a92025f70b9f9ff72", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:13:59.798239+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "da3f0c2a92025f70b9f9ff72", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "da3f0c2a92025f70b9f9ff72", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Thanks, John! Appreciate your help. We need to get the word out about the chili cook-off at the fundraiser. Here's the poster!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_16-4628489205682a92ea09636b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:13:59.823928+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "4628489205682a92ea09636b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "4628489205682a92ea09636b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Wow, it looks awesome! I'll make sure to spread the word about it. Is there anything else I can do to assist?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_16-f96e49fbf3f4b2abb7b7c07f", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:13:59.846561+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f96e49fbf3f4b2abb7b7c07f", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f96e49fbf3f4b2abb7b7c07f", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Thanks, John! Your help is really appreciated. If you know anyone who might be interested in volunteering for the event, let me know. We can do this!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_16-150e35cde073114bb6a11372", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:13:59.869515+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "150e35cde073114bb6a11372", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "150e35cde073114bb6a11372", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Yep, Maria! I'll ask around to see if anyone I know wants to help. We'll find some awesome people for the cause. Let's make a change!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_16-e425ab683f54782c493cd7d5", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:13:59.898190+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "e425ab683f54782c493cd7d5", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "e425ab683f54782c493cd7d5", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Way to go, John! Let's help those in need. Thanks for your support!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_16-0993f068217febc6ac535875", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:13:59.918544+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0993f068217febc6ac535875", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0993f068217febc6ac535875", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: No problem, Maria! Working together with passionate people like you is awesome! Let's make a difference."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_16-05e5e77a361d621a898e37cf", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:13:59.937211+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "05e5e77a361d621a898e37cf", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "05e5e77a361d621a898e37cf", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Yeah, working with passionate people like you is really motivating."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_16-3fda867c374fe114c29fe2e5", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:13:59.955966+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "3fda867c374fe114c29fe2e5", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "3fda867c374fe114c29fe2e5", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Yeah, Maria! We're making a difference and we'll keep it up! Here's a pic of my fam at the beach."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_16-66612fbcaf4cf761520731fd", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:13:59.968877+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "66612fbcaf4cf761520731fd", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "66612fbcaf4cf761520731fd", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Wow, John, that pic is gorgeous! It really gives me hope to appreciate the little moments."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_16-5f216aa46249b517ba1f3e41", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:13:59.984636+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "5f216aa46249b517ba1f3e41", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "5f216aa46249b517ba1f3e41", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Thanks, Maria! It's moments like these that give me hope too."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_16-6813c40eb3cccffc556cbafb", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:14:00.002560+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "6813c40eb3cccffc556cbafb", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "6813c40eb3cccffc556cbafb", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Yeah, John! They give me peace and make me appreciate life."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_16-8d03d0edbc361f693f25f23f", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:14:00.017066+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "8d03d0edbc361f693f25f23f", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "8d03d0edbc361f693f25f23f", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Glad the photo made you feel that way, Maria. Cherish those little moments!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_16-d7b7ce25a9d671aa11256696", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:14:00.032066+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d7b7ce25a9d671aa11256696", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d7b7ce25a9d671aa11256696", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Thanks, John. I definitely will!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_16-f63f67cd433418eb7a95e612", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:14:00.051353+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f63f67cd433418eb7a95e612", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f63f67cd433418eb7a95e612", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Thanks for letting me help, Maria. It's moments like these that make life worth living."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_16-a0cb4d7981a21949ce1c379c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:14:00.063375+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a0cb4d7981a21949ce1c379c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a0cb4d7981a21949ce1c379c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Yep, John. These reminders help us stay motivated to make a positive impact. Well, talk to you soon!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_16-f6c370e7ebc348ef8c6f3ff9", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:14:00.083441+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f6c370e7ebc348ef8c6f3ff9", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f6c370e7ebc348ef8c6f3ff9", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Yeah, Maria! We're really making progress towards making a positive impact. I believe in us! See ya!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_16-38b5bcdeea9a30d760e6eb0c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:14:00.101499+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "38b5bcdeea9a30d760e6eb0c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "38b5bcdeea9a30d760e6eb0c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
